Base-Commit: 876adebaf2f612951dcdca8a591de65401222b9a
Subject: Remove the unused Sparkle update runtime

YunPin ships updates as explicit installer packages and does not expose an
in-app update channel.  Remove Sparkle from the source checkout, build graph,
application code, bundle metadata, and package component list so a system-wide
input method cannot retain an inactive privileged updater surface.

